{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VqoCyzoERtPVHK8WFSfpsH","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"TrackMania 2003 \"survival\" mode how it works review puzzle mode limited blocks\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"TrackMania (2003 video game)\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TrackMania_(2003_video_game)\"},{\"title\":\"TrackMania\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TrackMania\"},{\"title\":\"TrackMania (2003 video game)\",\"url\":\"https://wikipedia.com/wiki/TrackMania_Original\"},{\"title\":\"TrackMania (2003 video game)\",\"url\":\"https://ipfs.ssi.eecc.de/ipns/en.wikipedia-on-ipfs.org/wiki/TrackMania_(2003_video_game)\"},{\"title\":\"TrackMania PC Review\",\"url\":\"https://www.tweaktown.com/gaming/2072/trackmania_pc_review/index.html\"},{\"title\":\"User Rating: 8.8 | TrackMania (2003) PC\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamespot.com/trackmania/user-reviews/2200-43615/\"},{\"title\":\"www.mobygames.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.mobygames.com/game/12151/trackmania/reviews/\"},{\"title\":\"TrackMania (2003 video game)\",\"url\":\"https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/TrackMania_(2003_video_game)\"},{\"title\":\"bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io\",\"url\":\"https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/TrackMania.html\"},{\"title\":\"www.gamingnexus.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamingnexus.com/Article/523/Review/\"},{\"title\":\"Nadeo Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://nadeo.fandom.com/wiki/Stunts\"},{\"title\":\"game score\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamepressure.com/games/game_score.asp?ID=3465\"},{\"title\":\"Games Encyclopedia Top Games PC PS4 PS3 Xbox One Xbox 360 Switch Android iOS Rankings Images Companies\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamepressure.com/games/trackmania/z5d89\"},{\"title\":\"trackmania 2003\",\"url\":\"https://static01.gog.com/dreamlist/game/trackmania-2003\"},{\"title\":\"trackmania 2003\",\"url\":\"https://respawn.media/games/trackmania-2003\"},{\"title\":\"trackmania 2003\",\"url\":\"https://static03.gog.com/dreamlist/game/trackmania-2003\"},{\"title\":\"la recensione di trackmania\",\"url\":\"https://multiplayer.it/recensioni/la-recensione-di-trackmania.html\"},{\"title\":\"trackmania 1\",\"url\":\"https://playpile.gg/games/trackmania-1\"}]\n\nThe search turned up consistent but thin coverage of Survival mode. Nothing I found covers how Puzzle mode's block limits work.\n\n- **Origin:** Survival appears to have arrived with the Power Up! expansion. One review says the Power Up! pack adds underground passage building, a solo \"survival\" mode, and 40 new blocks to unlock. MobyGames likewise says Survival was added in the Power Up! patch.\n- **Rules:** You race three computer-controlled ghost cars across more than twenty tracks. Finishing first or second moves you up in rank, and finishing last ends the run. (MobyGames, Survival mode has you racing against three ghost cars, over twenty tracks, to see how far you can get. By winning a race you rise in rank and only if you finish last is the survival game over.) A separate review describes it as pitting you against multiple computer racers for first, second, or third place.\n- **Reception:** Reviewers praised the mode. A GameSpot user rating calls the modes great fun in their own right. TweakTown calls it sort of like the classic Survival mode seen in fighting games.\n- **Legacy:** The \"Survival\" mode does not appear in the later games, though Platform bears some slight similarities in map styles.\n- **Puzzle mode and block limits:** None of the results describe Puzzle mode's block restrictions. The closest is TweakTown's note that unlocking the full track designer comes after playing a significant part of the offline modes, which include \"Racing\", \"Puzzle\" and \"Survival\". A follow-up search aimed at Puzzle mode's block rules would be needed to answer that part.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d5c8bd7-2207-47fe-9b8b-c2b43fe30800","uuid":"fffdf3b8-0dd8-4bc9-91f6-ec166a0a234f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:52:24.102Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"TrackMania 2003 \"survival\" mode how it works review puzzle mode limited blocks","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01TRoqvfU4wPNQDhec5L4eHc","content":[{"title":"TrackMania (2003 video game)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TrackMania_(2003_video_game)"},{"title":"TrackMania","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TrackMania"},{"title":"TrackMania (2003 video game)","url":"https://wikipedia.com/wiki/TrackMania_Original"},{"title":"TrackMania (2003 video game)","url":"https://ipfs.ssi.eecc.de/ipns/en.wikipedia-on-ipfs.org/wiki/TrackMania_(2003_video_game)"},{"title":"TrackMania PC Review","url":"https://www.tweaktown.com/gaming/2072/trackmania_pc_review/index.html"},{"title":"User Rating: 8.8 | TrackMania (2003) PC","url":"https://www.gamespot.com/trackmania/user-reviews/2200-43615/"},{"title":"www.mobygames.com","url":"https://www.mobygames.com/game/12151/trackmania/reviews/"},{"title":"TrackMania (2003 video game)","url":"https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/TrackMania_(2003_video_game)"},{"title":"bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io","url":"https://bafybeiemxf5abjwjbikoz4mc3a3dla6ual3jsgpdr4cjr3oz3evfyavhwq.ipfs.4everland.io/wiki/TrackMania.html"},{"title":"www.gamingnexus.com","url":"https://www.gamingnexus.com/Article/523/Review/"},{"title":"Nadeo Wiki","url":"https://nadeo.fandom.com/wiki/Stunts"},{"title":"game score","url":"https://www.gamepressure.com/games/game_score.asp?ID=3465"},{"title":"Games Encyclopedia Top Games PC PS4 PS3 Xbox One Xbox 360 Switch Android iOS Rankings Images Companies","url":"https://www.gamepressure.com/games/trackmania/z5d89"},{"title":"trackmania 2003","url":"https://static01.gog.com/dreamlist/game/trackmania-2003"},{"title":"trackmania 2003","url":"https://respawn.media/games/trackmania-2003"},{"title":"trackmania 2003","url":"https://static03.gog.com/dreamlist/game/trackmania-2003"},{"title":"la recensione di trackmania","url":"https://multiplayer.it/recensioni/la-recensione-di-trackmania.html"},{"title":"trackmania 1","url":"https://playpile.gg/games/trackmania-1"}]},"The search turned up consistent but thin coverage of Survival mode. Nothing I found covers how Puzzle mode's block limits work.\n\n- **Origin:** Survival appears to have arrived with the Power Up! expansion. One review says the Power Up! pack adds underground passage building, a solo \"survival\" mode, and 40 new blocks to unlock. MobyGames likewise says Survival was added in the Power Up! patch.\n- **Rules:** You race three computer-controlled ghost cars across more than twenty tracks. Finishing first or second moves you up in rank, and finishing last ends the run. (MobyGames, Survival mode has you racing against three ghost cars, over twenty tracks, to see how far you can get. By winning a race you rise in rank and only if you finish last is the survival game over.) A separate review describes it as pitting you against multiple computer racers for first, second, or third place.\n- **Reception:** Reviewers praised the mode. A GameSpot user rating calls the modes great fun in their own right. TweakTown calls it sort of like the classic Survival mode seen in fighting games.\n- **Legacy:** The \"Survival\" mode does not appear in the later games, though Platform bears some slight similarities in map styles.\n- **Puzzle mode and block limits:** None of the results describe Puzzle mode's block restrictions. The closest is TweakTown's note that unlocking the full track designer comes after playing a significant part of the offline modes, which include \"Racing\", \"Puzzle\" and \"Survival\". A follow-up search aimed at Puzzle mode's block rules would be needed to answer that part."],"durationSeconds":7.744742529999988,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VqoCyzoERtPVHK8WFSfpsH","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
