{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011U1naYo3F5GYZhENL3mou3","type":"tool_result","content":"2D engine 0.85.2 headless default? true\n3D module imported in 52 ms; World3D? function THREE rev 182\nusing deprecated parameters for the initialization function; pass a single object instead\nmy-3D2dge: the level uses \"@\", which its legend does not say: it is floor\nworld made; pw? true gravity {\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"z\":-480}\nbox z after 2s 33.24 ray toi 175.00 normal {\"x\":0,\"y\":-0.4472135901451111,\"z\":0.8944271802902222}\nhash e87c8bc4\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174810__xbd1c73/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d5c8bd7-2207-47fe-9b8b-c2b43fe30800","uuid":"ff8b9b12-1b46-430a-a93b-d9ccae98d075","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:59:05.945Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"2D engine 0.85.2 headless default? true\n3D module imported in 52 ms; World3D? function THREE rev 182\nusing deprecated parameters for the initialization function; pass a single object instead\nmy-3D2dge: the level uses \"@\", which its legend does not say: it is floor\nworld made; pw? true gravity {\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"z\":-480}\nbox z after 2s 33.24 ray toi 175.00 normal {\"x\":0,\"y\":-0.4472135901451111,\"z\":0.8944271802902222}\nhash e87c8bc4","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174810__xbd1c73/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011U1naYo3F5GYZhENL3mou3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
