oad`), its `IS` is ice.\")\nrep('SURFACES (dirt, ice, snow variants) 200 ¢', 'SURFACES (dirt and ice variants) 200 ¢')\nrep('<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Best lap time in 3 minutes wins: retry as often as you like\">',\n    '<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Best time in 3 minutes wins; retry as often as you like\">')\nrep('<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"R2/W gas, L2/S brake, stick/arrows steer, ○/Enter respawn, △/Delete restart\">',\n    '<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"R2/W gas · L2/S brake · stick/arrows steer · Circle/Enter respawn\">')\nrep(\"- **Banked**: as the turn; bank `β(φ) = 28°·sin(π·φ/(π/2))`;\", \"- **Banked**: as the turn; bank `β(φ) = 28°·sin(2φ)` (0 at both ports, 28° mid-bend);\")\nrep(\"ambient, camera: { mode: 'fixed', far }, onDraw }); materials + textures; TrackView;\",\n    \"ambient, camera: { mode: 'fixed', far }, overlay: { fov: 80 } (hood cam), onDraw }); materials,\\n                                textures; TrackView;\")\nrep(\"2. Pick the round's track with `AIHub.rng('track')` from the session list **D1, D2, D3, R1, R2, S1, S2** (`info.round`\\n   advances the stream naturally); load it.\",\n    \"2. Pick the round's track with `AIHub.rng('track')` from the session list **D1, D2, D3, R1, R2, S1, S2** (the same\\n   pick on every copy; the seed changes per round, so rounds rotate tracks); load it.\")\nrep(\"7. At 3:00 by `AIHub.time()` — or at once on `time-up` — call\",\n    \"7. At 3:00 by `AIHub.time()` (or 5 s before `info.limitMs` if that is sooner) — or at once on `time-up` — call\")\nrep(\"Colour script:\\nDustbowl warm oranges/teal sky; Hedgerow greens/yellows/white; Frostpeak whites/blues with pink sky and warm lamps.\",\n    \"Colour script:\\nDustbowl warm oranges/teal sky; Hedgerow greens/yellows/white; Frostpeak whites/blues with pink sky and warm lamps.\\nTASK.md treats performance as unlimited: dress scenes generously (sun shadows on, dense scenery, crowds, animated\\nprops, lamps) — but still never create materials after boot.\")\nopen(p, 'w', encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nEOF\ngrep -n \"SN\\b\" PLAN.md | head; grep -n \"chasm\" PLAN.md | head -20","description":"Apply review fixes to PLAN.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8305,"cache_read_input_tokens":514901,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8305},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d5c8bd7-2207-47fe-9b8b-c2b43fe30800","uuid":"ae0b801f-15f4-47d5-84de-5f154ab694bb","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:39:52.839Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh2yR5GNwSEFwa2gvUk3","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_019FYRW1ba1zLoTwwQ7XJ2Wc":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174810__xbd1c73/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\np = 'PLAN.md'\ns = open(p, encoding='utf-8').read()\ndef rep(a, b, count=1):\n    global s\n    n = s.count(a)\n    assert n == count, (n, a[:70])\n    s = s.replace(a, b)\nrep('one was drawn with an OS-entropy RNG (`python3 -c \"import secrets; secrets.randbelow(50)\"` → index 8 → *Crackmania*).',\n    'one was drawn with an OS-entropy RNG (Python `secrets.randbelow(50)` over the list → index 8 → *Crackmania*).')\nrep('Read sections 0–3 whole before writing code; sections 4–9 are the reference you build each system from.',\n    'Read sections 0–3 whole before writing code; sections 4–12 and the appendices are the reference you build each\\nsystem from.')\nrep('| Snow road variants | `SN` (straight) | as S | | | snow | 5 | Frostpeak |\\n', '')\nrep('| Gap | `GAPn` | n×1×2 reserved air | — | nothing (a reserved corridor); at level 0 the base plate is cut: **chasm** | — | 0 | all |',\n    '| Gap | `GAPn` | n×1×2 reserved air |