{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U6zLkFW4V9NGutdzD8nf3x","type":"tool_result","content":"955\t| R5 | Tractor Pull | (2,10) | `ST S BO S2 U2 S DR2 DS2 DL1 BU S CP S LOOPL S2 R2 S BO KI GAP2 LA S CP R2 S3 D2 S BO S2 CP S2 FN` | 1611 | 3 | finale: elevated farm ridge, dirt, a left loop |\n956\t| S1 | First Flake | (3,4) | `ST S2 IS2 S R2 S CP S2 L2 IS2 S2 FN` | 631 | 1 | ice: lift off before the bend |\n957\t| S2 | Pine Slalom | (2,6) | `ST S2 R1 L1 L1 R1 S2 CP S U2 S2 D2 R2 S CP S2 FN` | 756 | 2 | slalom on snow, braking points |\n958\t| S3 | Avalanche Drop | (2,6) | `ST S U2 S U2 S U2 S CP S R2 S BO KI GAP3 DROP2 LA S CP S BO S2 L2 S2 D1 S FN` | 1182 | 2 | climb three levels, a huge drop jump |\n959\t| S4 | Glacier Loop | (2,4) | `ST S2 BO S IS2 LOOPR S CP S BR2 IS2 S BR2 S2 BO S2 FN` | 898 | 1 | a loop entered off ice, banked ice bends |\n960\t| S5 | Yeti Summit | (2,16) | `ST S BO S U2 S U2 S CP S L2 S U2 S2 R2 BO KI GAP2 LA S CP S R2 S2 LOOPR S IS2 D2 S D2 S CP R2 S2 D2 S BO S FN` | 1925 | 3 | finale: summit road, jump, loop, icy descent |\n961\t\n962\tEnvironment rules for tokens: dirt (`D*`) and bumps only in Hedgerow (and dirt in the editor's Dustbowl Surfaces\n963\tpack); ice (`I*`) only in Frostpeak; Frostpeak's plain `S`/turns are packed-snow road (surface `road`), its `IS` is ice. R4's GAP2 sits over a **pond** (the chasm cells get a water surface 2 m down instead of a canyon:\n964\tfalling in = splash + respawn). D2's and D5's gaps are canyons; S3's is an elevated drop (no chasm).\n965\t\n966\tSession tracks for AI Hub rounds: D1, D2, D3, R1, R2, S1, S2. Title showcase: D3. Attract race: D5.\n967\t\n968\t### 6.4 Puzzles (6) — fixed blocks and inventories computed from validated solutions\n969\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d5c8bd7-2207-47fe-9b8b-c2b43fe30800","uuid":"8a3730ec-5740-497e-9e61-ba1c67fda6c6","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:39:57.354Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174810__xbd1c73/work/PLAN.md","content":"| R5 | Tractor Pull | (2,10) | `ST S BO S2 U2 S DR2 DS2 DL1 BU S CP S LOOPL S2 R2 S BO KI GAP2 LA S CP R2 S3 D2 S BO S2 CP S2 FN` | 1611 | 3 | finale: elevated farm ridge, dirt, a left loop |\n| S1 | First Flake | (3,4) | `ST S2 IS2 S R2 S CP S2 L2 IS2 S2 FN` | 631 | 1 | ice: lift off before the bend |\n| S2 | Pine Slalom | (2,6) | `ST S2 R1 L1 L1 R1 S2 CP S U2 S2 D2 R2 S CP S2 FN` | 756 | 2 | slalom on snow, braking points |\n| S3 | Avalanche Drop | (2,6) | `ST S U2 S U2 S U2 S CP S R2 S BO KI GAP3 DROP2 LA S CP S BO S2 L2 S2 D1 S FN` | 1182 | 2 | climb three levels, a huge drop jump |\n| S4 | Glacier Loop | (2,4) | `ST S2 BO S IS2 LOOPR S CP S BR2 IS2 S BR2 S2 BO S2 FN` | 898 | 1 | a loop entered off ice, banked ice bends |\n| S5 | Yeti Summit | (2,16) | `ST S BO S U2 S U2 S CP S L2 S U2 S2 R2 BO KI GAP2 LA S CP S R2 S2 LOOPR S IS2 D2 S D2 S CP R2 S2 D2 S BO S FN` | 1925 | 3 | finale: summit road, jump, loop, icy descent |\n\nEnvironment rules for tokens: dirt (`D*`) and bumps only in Hedgerow (and dirt in the editor's Dustbowl Surfaces\npack); ice (`I*`) only in Frostpeak; Frostpeak's plain `S`/turns are packed-snow road (surface `road`), its `IS` is ice. R4's GAP2 sits over a **pond** (the chasm cells get a water surface 2 m down instead of a canyon:\nfalling in = splash + respawn). D2's and D5's gaps are canyons; S3's is an elevated drop (no chasm).\n\nSession tracks for AI Hub rounds: D1, D2, D3, R1, R2, S1, S2. Title showcase: D3. Attract race: D5.\n\n### 6.4 Puzzles (6) — fixed blocks and inventories computed from validated solutions\n","numLines":15,"startLine":955,"totalLines":1418}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01U6zLkFW4V9NGutdzD8nf3x","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh31Mn93vgwayQzRXfSm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YVshUUFaUtxrZ1fwZ8ijhp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np = 'PLAN.md'\ns = open(p, encoding='utf-8').read()\nold = \"\"\"Environment rules for tokens: dirt (`D*`) and bumps only in Hedgerow (and dirt in the editor's Dustbowl Surfaces\npack); ice (`I*`) only in Frostpeak; Frostpeak's plain `S`/turns are packed-snow road (surface `road`), its `IS` is ice. R4's GAP2 sits over a **pond** (the chasm cells get a water surface 2 m down instead of a canyon:\nfalling in = splash + respawn). D2's and D5's gaps are canyons; S3's is an elevated drop (no chasm).\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"Environment rules for tokens: dirt (`D*`) and bumps only in Hedgerow (and dirt in the editor's Dustbowl Surfaces\npack); ice (`I*`) only in Frostpeak; Frostpeak's plain `S`/turns are packed-snow road (surface `road`), its `IS` is\nice.\n\n**Chasms per track** (each track's data carries a `chasms` list: cells with no base plate, and what is below them):\nD2 — its two level-0 `GAP2`s are **canyons** (rock walls, 60 m deep); D5 — its `GAP3` is on level 1, and the three\ncells under it are marked canyon too: *the Big Crack*; R2 — its level-0 `GAP1` is a **stream** (water 2 m down);\nR4 — its level-0 `GAP2` is the **mill pond** (water). Water: falling in = splash + respawn; canyon: fall, fade,\nrespawn. Elevated gaps elsewhere (D4, R5, S3, S5) have plain ground below — you land on the plate and can drive back\nor respawn.\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old) == 1\ns = s.replace(old, new)\nold2 = \"- **Base plate** (per track): one mesh of the grid's cells minus chasm cells (GAP cells on level 0); environment ground\"\nassert s.count(old2) == 1\ns = s.replace(old2, \"- **Base plate** (per track): one mesh of the grid's cells minus the track's chasm cells (§6.3); environment ground\")\nold3 = \"**Chasm walls**: for each chasm cell edge that borders plate, a vertical quad down 60 m with the\\n  terrain rock texture.\"\nassert s.count(old3) == 1\ns = s.replace(old3, \"**Chasm walls**: for each chasm cell edge that borders plate, a vertical quad down 60 m with the\\n  terrain rock texture (canyons) or down 2 m to a water surface mesh (streams, ponds; water is a `water` trigger).\")\nopen(p, 'w', encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nEOF","description":"Rewrite the chasm rules paragraph and related lines"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1259,"cache_read_input_tokens":526682,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1259},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d5c8bd7-2207-47fe-9b8b-c2b43fe30800","uuid":"c8452445-3dc4-491e-9793-9f1d727ae7b4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:40:07.035Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh31MWm7Tr438XNbX6N7","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01YVshUUFaUtxrZ1fwZ8ijhp":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174810__xbd1c73/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\np = 'PLAN.md'\ns = open(p, encoding='utf-8').read()\nold = \"\"\"Environment rules for tokens: dirt (`D*`) and bumps only in Hedgerow (and dirt in the editor's Dustbowl Surfaces\npack); ice (`I*`) only in Frostpeak; Frostpeak's plain `S`/turns are packed-snow road (surface `road`), its `IS` is ice. R4's GAP2 sits over a **pond** (the chasm cells get a water surface 2 m down instead of a canyon:\nfalling in = splash + respawn). D2's and D5's gaps are canyons; S3's is an elevated drop (no chasm).\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"Environment rules for tokens: dirt (`D*`) and bumps only in Hedgerow (and dirt in the editor's Dustbowl Surfaces\npack); ice (`I*`) only in Frostpeak; Frostpeak's plain `S`/turns are packed-snow road (surface `road`), its `IS` is\nice.\n\n**Chasms per track** (each track's data carries a `chasms` list: cells with no base plate, and what is below them):\nD2 — its two level-0 `GAP2`s are **canyons** (rock walls, 60 m deep); D5 — its `GAP3` is on level 1, and the three\ncells under it are marked canyon too: *the Big Crack*; R2 — its level-0 `GAP1` is a **stream** (water 2 m down);\nR4 — its level-0 `GAP2` is the **mill pond** (water). Water: falling in = splash + respawn; canyon: fall, fade,\nrespawn. Elevated gaps elsewhere (D4, R5, S3, S5) have plain ground below — you land on the plate and can drive back\nor respawn.\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old) == 1\ns = s.replace(old, new)\nold2 = \"- **Base plate** (per track): one mesh of the grid's cells minus chasm cells (GAP cells on level 0); environment ground\"\nassert s.count(old2) == 1\ns = s.replace(old2, \"- **Base plate** (per track): one mesh of the grid's cells minus the track's chasm cells (§6.3); environment ground\")\nold3 = \"**Chasm walls**: for each chasm cell edge that borders plate, a vertical quad down 60 m with the\\n  terrain rock texture.\"\nassert s.count(old3) == 1\ns = s.replace(old3, \"**Chasm walls**: for each chasm cell edge that borders plate, a vertical quad down 60 m with the\\n  terrain rock texture (canyons) or down 2 m to a water surface mesh (streams, ponds; water is a `water` trigger).\")\nopen(p, 'w', encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nEOF","description":"Rewrite the chasm rules paragraph and related lines"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01YVshUUFaUtxrZ1fwZ8ijhp":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174810__xbd1c73/work"}}}
