dable; kicker reserves its gap; undo/redo 50 random ops returns to the same state and coppers; validate (bot drive) sets author + medals; any edit clears validation; save/load slots; share code round trip; export-as-content output compiles |\n1260:| `playthrough` | **the whole game, scripted**: fresh profile → welcome beat → all 15 races driven by the bot as the player through the real menus (pressing the real buttons) → medals, coppers and unlocks as designed → the 6 puzzles solved through the editor UI → each gauntlet run (bot at skill 1 clears it) → build and validate a 12-block track in the editor, save, reload, share code → paint a car in the garage → save and reopen a replay → hot seat (2 players) and split screen (2 players) races → golds everywhere → ending beat and credits → final profile matches expectations; 0 engine errors |\n1322:| Headless testing of a 3D engine | The loader in §9.1 was run successfully during planning; keep pure logic (track model, CarSim, run, bot, economy, editor ops) free of three.js calls so most suites don't depend on rendering at all |\n1328:| Shader stalls on track load / editing | All materials and pen batches (incl. ghost) made at boot; `world.prepare()`; only geometry changes later; dispose old geometries |\n1400:    c.load = vt2 * c.kappa - pull + aEff;                                   // normal load per unit mass","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VdiDRyaViYBzMGo8rjFU9E","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
