autopilot, which tests, medal times, rivals and the attract mode all depend on. The plan also lists the main risks and how to handle each one.\n\n**Testing.** One command, `node tools/test.mjs`, prints only failures and a one-line count. It covers 15 test groups, including a scripted playthrough of the whole game, browser checks of the built file, and the AI Hub's own test page in three setups.\n\n**Checked while planning:**\n- **Headless engine:** the 3D engine runs headless in Node using the loader code in the plan.\n- **Single file:** a 4.5 MB test build opened from `file://` in headless Chromium with zero errors (it fell back to WebGL 2) and drew the scene.\n- **Track layouts:** all track and puzzle programs fit the grid with no overlaps.\n- **Car code:** the printed car code holds a 12 m loop on full throttle from about 47 km/h, or from about 107 km/h when coasting. It clears a two-cell jump from about 160 km/h and lands upright. A first version let cars climb the loop at any speed; the plan's version fixes that by limiting thrust to what the tyres can grip.\n\n**Your machine.** `/tmp` (a 9.8 GB tmpfs) was full when I started. I deleted only my own partial clone there and did the research on the main disk instead. I also deleted my 5.5 GB research folder in `~/.cache` at the end.","ttft_ms":1259,"type":"result","duration_ms":3517174,"uuid":"9b0c8d16-b493-4dd5-a709-9c12d08ec828","ttft_stream_ms":1078,"time_to_request_ms":141,"first_content_frame_ms":1078,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":266,"outputTokens":323067,"cacheReadInputTokens":38465141,"cacheCreationInputTokens":575407,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":18.758688199999998,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":202055,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":575407,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens